#. Description of the plugin
#: otp-verification-sms-for-gravity-forms.php
msgid "Adds Firebase phone OTP verification to Gravity Forms, plus SMS notifications via MSG91 or Twilio and Slack notifications."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: otp-verification-sms-for-gravity-forms.php
msgid "Cindova Technologies"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-settings.php:20
msgid "Settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-settings.php:34
msgid "When you verify your phone number on a form, your phone number is sent from your browser to Google Firebase Authentication, which sends you a one-time code by SMS and uses Google reCAPTCHA to prevent abuse. See the Google Privacy Policy: https://policies.google.com/privacy"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin-settings.php:35
msgid "After you submit a form, we may send an SMS to the phone number you entered through our SMS provider (MSG91 or Twilio), and we may post a notification containing some of the information you submitted to our Slack workspace. These providers process that data under their own privacy policies."
msgstr ""

